<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>So In Love</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Breezee</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">So In Love</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">45otrYoVWC5qGdSR0eK1zP</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.954" end="00:25.462">I tend to fantasize</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.462" end="00:28.047">About you and I (You and I)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.047" end="00:31.173">Feels like I’m on a ride</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.173" end="00:34.692">Like Aladdin Jasmine soaring through the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.692" end="00:36.951">It’s hard to describe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.951" end="00:39.972">When you’re stuck on my mind (Mind)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.972" end="00:44.498">But when the stars align</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.498" end="00:48.571">Baby, I am just so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.571" end="00:54.593">So in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.593" end="01:00.116">When it’s just us (When it's just us two)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.116" end="01:06.194">It must be the stars up above (Above)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.194" end="01:13.662">Making sure we are in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.662" end="01:18.181">We are in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.181" end="01:25.362">I said, "No, we’re so in love"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.362" end="01:31.383">We’re in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.383" end="01:35.649">My love’s on the table, so let’s put a label</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.649" end="01:38.409">I want the world to know that we are taken</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.409" end="01:41.421">Our story’s a fable, and I'm very grateful</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.421" end="01:44.183">'Cause we’re a fairy tale that’s in the making</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.183" end="01:46.942">And our story might go up, down, out, or in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.942" end="01:49.703">But the day you’re out, we’ll fall in love again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.703" end="01:52.963">It’ll never come to what we could’ve been</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.963" end="02:00.963">'Cause we’re forever till the end, and I’m so stuck on how we were always destined to be (To be)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.997" end="02:03.519">The two kids sittin’ in the tree (The tree)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.519" end="02:06.281">The lovers in the movies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.281" end="02:12.061">And when I sit next to you, it's something straight out of a scene (A scene)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.061" end="02:17.090">Like when I look into your eyes, I see the moon’s reflection when it gleams</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.090" end="02:21.354">Baby, I am just so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.354" end="02:26.625">So in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.625" end="02:32.408">When it’s just us (When it's just us two)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.408" end="02:38.191">It must be the stars up above (Above)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.191" end="02:44.717">Making sure we are in love (We're so in love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.717" end="02:50.748">We are in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.748" end="02:57.561">I said, "No, we’re so in love"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.561" end="03:01.561">We’re in love</p></div></body></tt>